{
  "about": [
    "Small value rules every app applies before saving or syncing. {\"repeat\": [s, n]} means s repeated n times.",
    "Trimming means JavaScript's white space (trim(), \\s): it includes U+FEFF and not U+0085, unlike .NET's Trim().",
    "cleanText (task text: line breaks and tabs become spaces, control characters go, trimmed; longer than",
    "  10000 characters is cut): desktop/sync-core.ps1 ConvertTo-CleanText, local/engine.mjs cleanText, worker/src/merge.js",
    "  normalizeText (the server; it refuses over-long text instead of cutting, so cases marked \"cut\" are not run there),",
    "  worker/public/js/markdown.js cleanText (the phone app; model.js re-exports it).",
    "cleanNotes (notes: CR removed, trailing spaces per line, leading / trailing empty lines): ConvertTo-CleanNotes,",
    "  engine cleanNotes, merge.js normalizeNotes, markdown.js cleanNotes.",
    "cleanTime (deadline time in a list line: H:MM or nothing): ConvertTo-CleanTime, markdown.js cleanTime.",
    "validDate (YYYY-MM-DD that exists, years 1-9999): Test-ValidDate, merge.js isValidDate, markdown.js isValidDate.",
    "projectName (a project / tab name: no characters Windows forbids in file names, no control characters, no trailing",
    "  dots or spaces, at most 100 characters; \"\" = not a usable name): ConvertTo-ProjectName, markdown.js cleanProjectName.",
    "fileName (a project name -> its list file name; reserved device names and empty names get \"Project \" in front):",
    "  ConvertTo-FileName, markdown.js toFileName.",
    "pairingLink (a pairing link or a bare key -> {key, server}, or null: https only, plain http just on this computer,",
    "  no user name in the address): desktop/sync-core.ps1 Get-PairingLink, worker/public/js/pairing.js parsePairingLink.",
    "inviteLink (an invite to a shared list -> {server, code}, or null: https://<server>/join#code=..., https://<server>/#join=...",
    "  or saqme://join?server=<encoded origin>&code=...; the same rules for the server as pairing links):",
    "  desktop/sync-core.ps1 Get-InviteLink, worker/public/js/pairing.js parseInviteLink.",
    "serverLabel (a sync server's short name, for a shared list whose name another list has: \"Groceries (from nuca)\"; the",
    "  account part of a workers.dev address, else the host without www. or saqme.): Get-ServerLabel, pairing.js serverLabel."
  ],
